hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"207","Muhammad bin Al-Ala bin Kurayb Al-Hamdani and Ali bin Muslim told us, they said: Ibn Abi Zaida told us, on the authority of Khaled bin Salamah, on the authority of Al-Bahi On the authority of Urwa, on the authority of Aisha, she said: “The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, used to remember God at all times.” This is the wording of the hadith of Abu Kurayb"
